-- PREAMBLE --

THIS INSTRUMENT is a commercially issued license, authored by IACONOUS
WORTHYSON under the 75th Avenue licensing framework. It is a governing
instrument -- available to any inventor, developer, or creator who
acquires it -- to protect and govern the work named in the Certificate
of Issuance above.

The For-Your-Eyes-Only Edition is the sight-only counterpart to the
standard and Exclusive editions of the 75th Avenue framework. Where the
standard instrument grants use under an Open Commons tier, and the
Exclusive Edition grants use only by purchase, this Edition grants no
use of any kind. It grants exactly one thing: the right to LOOK at the
Works, as deposited, in place. It confers sight. It does not confer
possession, and it never converts into any right of possession.

The Works governed by this issuance are held by their author as a
viewable but uncopyable public record: readable by anyone, ownable by
no one but the holder. The license author -- IACONOUS WORTHYSON --
holds no claim over the Works beyond the right to be named as the
author of this instrument.

========================================================================
ARTICLE I -- THE IMMUTABLE DEPOSIT AND THE DECLARATION OF PRIOR ART
========================================================================

S 1.1 The authoritative form of the Works is the IMMUTABLE DEPOSIT: the
single, dated, tamper-evident master record from which every authorized
view is served. The Deposit is anchored by two independent instruments:

    (a) a Zenodo (CERN) archival record, which assigns the Deposit a
        permanent Digital Object Identifier (DOI) and fixes its exact
        content under a citable, versioned, immutable entry; and

    (b) an OpenTimestamps proof, which anchors the cryptographic hash
        of the Deposit to the Bitcoin blockchain, fixing the moment of
        its existence beyond the power of any party to backdate or
        alter.

S 1.2 Together these anchors establish, for all time, WHAT the Works
are and WHEN they existed. The Deposit's hash is its identity. Any
artifact presented as the Works whose hash does not match the Deposit,
or which is not served from the Deposit, is not the Works -- it is an
unauthorized copy, and by S 1.1 it is self-evidently so.

S 1.3 The Deposit, from its first publication, constitutes a public
disclosure of prior art under applicable patent law. Any patent claim
that reads upon the concepts substantially described in the Works is
invalid by operation of prior art law, regardless of filing date. This
declaration is the constitutional foundation of this License; it cannot
be waived, modified, or transferred by any party under any circumstance.

========================================================================
ARTICLE II -- THE GRANT OF SIGHT
========================================================================

This License grants ONE permission, and only one.

------------------------------------------------------------------------
SIGHT
Free of charge. No permission required. No royalty owed.
------------------------------------------------------------------------

  * Any person may VIEW, READ, and INSPECT the Works as deposited, in
    place, for their own private evaluation and understanding.

  * This permission extends only to the transient technical processing
    strictly necessary to render a single view to the person viewing
    (the ordinary buffering a browser or reader performs to display
    what is on screen), and to nothing more.

------------------------------------------------------------------------
NOTHING FURTHER IS GRANTED
------------------------------------------------------------------------

  * No right to CLONE, copy, download for retention, save, export,
    cache beyond a single transient view, fork, or mirror the Works,
    in whole or in part, arises under this License.

  * No right to REDISTRIBUTE, re-host, re-publish, forward, transmit,
    or otherwise convey the Works to any third party arises.

  * No right to EXECUTE, run, load, deploy, modify, incorporate,
    extract from, or create any derivative of the Works arises.

  * There is no path within this License by which any of the above may
    be obtained. Sight is the whole of the grant. A person who wishes
    to do more than look must obtain a separate written instrument from
    the license holder governing a different edition; this instrument
    provides none.

========================================================================
ARTICLE III -- PROHIBITIONS ABSOLUTE
========================================================================

The following are FORBIDDEN under this License. They cannot be
purchased, waived, or negotiated away by any party -- including the
license holder.

[X] REPRODUCTION AND CLONING
    The Works may not be cloned (by `git clone`, fork, or any
    equivalent), copied byte-for-byte or in part, downloaded for
    retention, screenshotted or transcribed for reuse, or otherwise
    reproduced in any fixed form beyond a single transient on-screen
    view. Possession of a copy is itself the violation, whether or not
    the copy is ever used or shared.

[X] REDISTRIBUTION AND MIRRORING
    The Works may not be re-hosted, mirrored, re-published, forwarded,
    or transmitted to any third party by any means. Each viewer must
    come to the Deposit; the Works may not be carried to the viewer.

[X] EXECUTION AND DERIVATION
    The Works, being data, may not be loaded into, computed upon, or
    used to build, train, tune, evaluate, or seed any system, model,
    dataset, or derivative.

[X] AI TRAINING USE
    The Works, and any part or description of them, may not be used as
    training data, fine-tuning data, evaluation data, or any form of
    machine learning corpus, in whole or in part, under any
    circumstance.

[X] SURVEILLANCE
    The Works may not be used, directly or indirectly, to build, power,
    or enhance any system designed to monitor, track, profile, or
    surveil individuals without their knowledge and explicit ongoing
    consent.

[X] DISINFORMATION AND MANIPULATION
    The Works may not be used to produce, distribute, or amplify false
    information, to manufacture deceptive synthetic media, or to build
    systems designed to psychologically manipulate individuals against
    their own interests.

[X] PATENT FILING
    No party may file any patent claim that reads upon the concepts,
    architecture, or design principles disclosed in the Works. Violation
    constitutes immediate and permanent termination of all rights under
    this issuance, without notice.

========================================================================
ARTICLE IV -- THE EVIDENTIARY RECORD AND ENFORCEMENT
========================================================================

S 4.1 This License is enforced by PROOF, not by lock. It is
acknowledged plainly: no license, and no deposit, can physically
prevent a person who is permitted to view a thing from also copying it.
The FYEO instrument does not pretend otherwise.

S 4.2 What the Immutable Deposit of Article I provides instead is
certainty of evidence. Because the Deposit fixes the exact content of
the Works (by Zenodo DOI) and the exact moment of their existence (by
OpenTimestamps / Bitcoin), any copy that appears anywhere else is
provably (a) the property of the license holder, (b) prior in time to
the copy, and (c) taken in breach of the sole grant of Article II. The
copier cannot claim independent creation, cannot claim an earlier date,
and cannot claim a broader grant than sight, because the record fixed
all three before the copy existed.

S 4.3 Every unauthorized clone, mirror, download, or derivative is
therefore a self-proving breach: the Deposit is the plaintiff's exhibit,
already dated, already public, already immutable. The remedy for breach
is as provided by the applicable law of copyright, contract, and the
terms of this instrument.

S 4.4 Removal, alteration, or obscuring of the Deposit anchors (the
Zenodo DOI or the OpenTimestamps proof) from any copy is itself an
additional and independent breach.

